Third-party components
----------------------

libusb (https://libusb.info) — LGPL-2.1-or-later.

Porterage links libusb statically, which the LGPL permits on the condition that a
recipient can relink the program against a modified libusb. That condition is met
here: this repository contains the complete source of the program, and
Scripts/build-libusb.sh reproduces the exact libusb build that ships in a release,
so anyone can substitute their own copy and rebuild.

libusb itself is not modified.


